---
/**
 * The captions panel (hud.css: flat --bg-2, a hairline, radius 16). being-mount.ts writes the spoken line here
 * with textContent and keeps aria-busy set while the words are still arriving, so assistive technology reads each
 * line once, when it is complete.
 */
---

<div class="captions" data-captions aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false"></div>
